static const char chunk25[]=R"NATIVE_DATA(正确的"],"answer":1,"why":"German 在这里表示“德国的；德国人”。"},{"id":"word11","kind":"meaning","phase":"理解词义","wordId":"u1a-w12","title":"nationality 在这里是什么意思？","text":"Please check your nationality on the form.","options":["英国的；英国人","国籍","同事"],"answer":1,"why":"nationality 在这里表示“国籍”。"},{"id":"read0","kind":"read","phase":"阅读理解","title":"读懂这段信息","text":"I am Mei. I am from China, but I live in Bristol now. Ben is my colleague. He is Canadian and lives near our office. Our neighbour Rosa is from Brazil. Anna is French, but her home is in Bristol too. Tom is British. His colleague Max is German. On a registration form, nationality means the country you belong to. It does not always tell people where you live now. We often meet at a small café after work.","q":"Mei 现在住在哪里？","options":["Bristol","China","Canada"],"answer":0,"why":"from 后面是来源，live in 后面是现居地。"},{"id":"read1","kind":"read","phase":"阅读理解","title":"读懂这段信息","text":"I am Mei. I am from China, but I live in Bristol now. Ben is my colleague. He is Canadian and lives near our office. Our neighbour Rosa is from Brazil. Anna is French, but her home is in Bristol too. Tom is British. His colleague Max is German. On a registration form, nationality means the country you belong to. It does not always tell people where you live now. We often meet at a small café after work.","q":"谁是 Mei 的同事？","options":["Anna","Ben","Rosa"],"answer":1,"why":"Ben 是 colleague；Rosa 是 neighbour。"},{"id":"read2","kind":"read","phase":"阅读理解","title":"读懂这段信息","text":"I am Mei. I am from China, but I live in Bristol now. Ben is my colleague. He is Canadian and lives near our office. Our neighbour Rosa is from Brazil. Anna is French, but her home is in Bristol too. Tom is British. His colleague Max is German. On a registration form, nationality means the country you belong to. It does not always tell people where you live now. We often meet at a small café after work.","q":"Anna 是法国人，能否据此认定她现在住在法国？","options":["能，她一定住在法国","不能，她现在住在 Bristol","文章没有提到她住哪里"],"answer":1,"why":"国籍与现居地是不同信息。French 说明国籍，后文说明现居地。"},{"id":"listen0","kind":"listen","phase":"听力理解","title":"先听，再选择","text":"A: Hi, I am Sam. Are you from Canada? B: No, I am from Australia. I live in Leeds now. A: Nice to meet you.","q":"Sam 的交谈对象来自哪里？","options":["加拿大","澳大利亚","英国"],"answer":1,"why":"对方否定 Canada，并说明来自 Australia；Leeds 是现居地。"},{"id":"listen1","kind":"listen","phase":"听力理解","title":"先听，再选择","text":"A: Is Rosa your colleague? B: No, she is my neighbour. My colleague is Ben. He is Canadian.","q":"Rosa 与说话者是什么关系？","options":["同事","家人","邻居"],"answer":2,"why":"对方纠正 colleague，明确说是 neighbour。"},{"id":"listen2","kind":"listen","phase":"听力理解","title":"先听，再选择","text":"A: Are Anna and Max British? B: No. Anna is French, and Max is German. They both live in Bristol. A: So Bristol is their home now? B: Yes.","q":"哪一项符合对话？","options":["两个人现在都住在 Bristol","两个人都是英国人","Anna 是德国人"],"answer":0,"why":"听懂两个人的国籍后，还要保留共同的现居地信息。"},{"id":"gap","kind":"gap","phase":"换情境运用","title":"把表达放回句子","text":"M)NATIVE_DATA";
