static const char chunk62[]=R"NATIVE_DATA(e, this overhead became the bottleneck. Caching mitigated repeated work, yet it did not reduce the latency of the first request. A second experiment increased throughput by processing requests together, while the longest waits became worse. Neither result supports an unqualified claim that the system is faster. The report should separate first-request latency, cached replay and throughput, using representative workloads and the same output-quality checks for every comparison.","question":"为什么不能笼统说系统更快？","options":["因为没有任何数据","吞吐提升但最长等待变差","输出质量已经完全失效"],"answer":1,"why":"指标之间存在权衡，不能以偏概全。"},{"id":"r2","kind":"read","text":"The smaller model reduced memory use but introduced additional setup overhead for each chunk. On the target device, this overhead became the bottleneck. Caching mitigated repeated work, yet it did not reduce the latency of the first request. A second experiment increased throughput by processing requests together, while the longest waits became worse. Neither result supports an unqualified claim that the system is faster. The report should separate first-request latency, cached replay and throughput, using representative workloads and the same output-quality checks for every comparison.","question":"比较时应控制什么？","options":["随意更换质量标准","只比较最好的一次缓存","代表性工作负载及相同输出质量检查"],"answer":2,"why":"最后一句说明比较条件。"}],"listen":[{"id":"l0","kind":"listen","text":"A: The cached replay takes almost no time. B: That does not tell us how long the first request takes. A: Right. We should publish both timings with the same sentence and quality settings.","question":"应该怎样报告速度？","options":["只报缓存速度","分别报告首次与缓存，保持比较条件一致","把播放时间当生成时间"],"answer":1,"why":"两类用时需要分开。"},{"id":"l1","kind":"listen","text":"A: Can we fix the bottleneck with more threads? B: Perhaps, but memory access may already be saturated. A: Then measure that before adding concurrency.","question":"增加并发前应先做什么？","options":["确认是否受内存访问限制","自动降低所有音质","删除缓存"],"answer":0,"why":"may 指出待测假设，不是已确定的结论。"}]}},"audio":{"country":"audio/92122799618cedcbf928.wav","Which country are you from?":"audio/7f39dc1d4cb543f17ac7.wav","city":"audio/655d06dab5ffcc012e33.wav","I live in a small city.":"audio/fa03e6a1f704584f719d.wav","from":"audio/9bd42f9c5d6e02345111.wav","She is from Canada.":"audio/aab5e36821fb23917256.wav","live":"audio/ea3fafa5d7c676675c13.wav","We live near the station.":"audio/722336f89b98d8acef56.wav","meet":"audio/0c83231312160b956900.wav","It is nice to meet you.":"audio/5df85aa76c6a27ec6bfd.wav","colleague":"audio/e1f87792c5813f82a1a0.wav","This is my colleague, Ben.":"audio/915883468d5ec90a7ab2.wav","Canadian":"audio/0aedc62d01afba6cb93a.wav","My colleague is Canadian.":"audio/3c4f3d5d023eb511fd36.wav","neighbour":"audio/202e5c40eb5fa4d8f093.wav","Our neighbour is from Brazil.":"audio/9f7637ed9bbf3106a5ab.wav","British":"audio/059f6a61299dd0e64283.wav","My new neighbour is British.":"audio/3d353c8afc7f078f1c82.wav","French":"audio/2ff6c56ee62d34acb277.wav","She is French, but she lives in Bristol.")NATIVE_DATA";
